---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-PT">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>NCS-Studio — A equipa de tecnologia completa para o teu negócio crescer</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Websites premium, plataformas, automações com IA e sistemas à medida — entregues prontos a funcionar. Sem freelancers desaparecidos. Sem projetos a metade." />
  <meta name="keywords" content="website premium, automação IA, CRM, sistema digital, plataforma SaaS, NCS-Studio, desenvolvimento web, backoffice" />
  <meta name="author" content="NCS-Studio" />
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://ncs.studio/" />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://ncs.studio/" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="NCS-Studio — A equipa de tecnologia completa para o teu negócio" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="Website, automações, CRM e infraestrutura digital — entregues prontos a funcionar, sem saberes código." />
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://ncs.studio/og-image.jpg" />
  <meta property="og:locale" content="pt_PT" />
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="NCS-Studio" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="NCS-Studio — Tecnologia que faz o teu negócio crescer" />
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="Websites, automações e sistemas entregues a funcionar. Sem código. Sem stress." />
  <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://ncs.studio/og-image.jpg" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css" />
  <style>
    @keyframes pulse-dot {
      0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(34,197,94,0.2); }
      50%       { box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(34,197,94,0.08); }
    }
    .v3-marquee { overflow: hidden; position: relative; }
    .v3-marquee::before,
    .v3-marquee::after {
      content: ""; position: absolute; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 120px; z-index: 2; pointer-events: none;
    }
    .v3-marquee::before { left: 0;  background: linear-gradient(to right,  var(--neo-bg, #0a0c0f), transparent); }
    .v3-marquee::after  { right: 0; background: linear-gradient(to left,   var(--neo-bg, #0a0c0f), transparent); }
    .v3-marquee-track {
      display: flex; gap: 10px; width: max-content;
      animation: v3scroll 32s linear infinite;
    }
    .v3-marquee:hover .v3-marquee-track { animation-play-state: paused; }
    @keyframes v3scroll {
      from { transform: translateX(0); }
      to   { transform: translateX(-50%); }
    }
    .neo-stack-tag {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      padding: 13px 22px; border-radius: 999px; white-space: nowrap;
      font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.045);
    }
    .neo-stack-tag::before {
      content: ""; width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
    }

    /* ── Solution block ── */
    .v3-sol {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      border-radius: 24px; overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    }
    .v3-sol-copy {
      padding: clamp(32px,5vw,56px);
      background: var(--neo-bg-2, #0b1023);
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 20px;
    }
    .v3-sol-copy h2 { font-size: clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.6rem); }
    .v3-sol-copy p  { opacity: 0.65; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.68; }
    .v3-sol-panel {
      padding: clamp(28px,4vw,44px);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.025);
      border-left: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; justify-content: center;
    }
    .v3-row {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 40px 1fr auto;
      align-items: center; gap: 12px;
      padding: 13px 15px; border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
      cursor: default;
      transition: transform 0.25s ease, background 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
    }
    .v3-row:hover {
      transform: translateX(6px);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.075);
      border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.16);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
    }
    .v3-av {
      width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 10px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.12), rgba(255,255,255,0.04));
    }
    .v3-row strong { display: block; font-size: 0.86rem; }
    .v3-row span   { font-size: 0.76rem; opacity: 0.5; }
    .v3-tag {
      padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .v3-tag.novo   { background: rgba(200,154,58,.15);  color: #d4a940; border: 1px solid rgba(200,154,58,.25); }
    .v3-tag.ag     { background: rgba(80,160,220,.14);  color: #72b8e8; border: 1px solid rgba(80,160,220,.22); }
    .v3-tag.fu     { background: rgba(200,100,60,.15);  color: #d4825a; border: 1px solid rgba(200,100,60,.22); }
    .v3-tag.re     { background: rgba(80,200,120,.13);  color: #5dc87a; border: 1px solid rgba(80,200,120,.22); }
    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .v3-sol { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .v3-sol-panel { border-left: none; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); }
    }

    /* ── Footer expandido ── */
    .ft {
      padding: 72px 0 0;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
      margin-top: 80px;
    }
    .ft-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.6fr 1fr 1fr 1.4fr;
      gap: 48px;
    }
    .ft-brand { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
    .ft-tagline { font-size: 0.88rem; opacity: 0.5; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 260px; }
    .ft-col h4 {
      font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase; opacity: 0.35; margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .ft-col ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
    .ft-col ul li a, .ft-col ul li span {
      font-size: 0.9rem; opacity: 0.6;
      text-decoration: none; color: inherit;
      transition: opacity 0.2s;
    }
    .ft-col ul li a:hover { opacity: 1; }
    .ft-newsletter { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
    .ft-newsletter p { font-size: 0.86rem; opacity: 0.5; line-height: 1.55; }
    .ft-form { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
    .ft-form input {
      flex: 1; padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 0.88rem;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      color: inherit; outline: none;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }
    .ft-form input::placeholder { opacity: 0.4; }
    .ft-form input:focus { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.28); }
    .ft-form button {
      padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 600;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
      color: inherit; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap;
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }
    .ft-form button:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.18); }
    .ft-bottom {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 24px 0 28px; margin-top: 48px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      font-size: 0.82rem; opacity: 0.4;
      flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px;
    }
    .ft-bottom a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; opacity: 0.7; }
    .ft-bottom a:hover { opacity: 1; }
    .ft-legal { display: flex; gap: 20px; }
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .ft-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .ft-brand { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .ft-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .ft-bottom { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body class="neo-body">
  <div class="neo-cursor" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <main class="neo-site">
    <div id="inicio" style="position:absolute;top:0;height:0;pointer-events:none;" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="neo-light neo-light-a" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="neo-light neo-light-b" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <header class="neo-nav">
      <a class="neo-brand" href="#inicio" aria-label="NCS-Studio home">
        <span class="neo-brand-mark"></span>
        NCS<span>Studio</span>
      </a>
      <nav class="neo-nav-links" aria-label="Navegação principal">
        <a href="#construimos">O que fazemos</a>
        <a href="#portfolio">Projetos aplicados</a>
        <a href="#incluido">O que está incluído</a>
      </nav>
      <a class="neo-btn neo-btn-small" href="/diagnostico">Reunião gratuita</a>
    </header>

    <!-- ── HERO ── -->
    <section class="neo-hero section-reveal">
      <div class="neo-hero-copy">
        <p class="neo-kicker">Sistemas digitais de atendimento para empresas que querem crescer sem improvisar</p>
        <h1>Transformamos o teu negócio numa operação digital que capta, organiza e acompanha clientes 24/7.</h1>
        <p class="neo-subhead">
          Desenvolvemos websites, CRM, automações com IA e infraestrutura completa, com design premium e implementação assistida. Ganha uma equipa tecnológica inteira sem contratar developers, designers, DevOps e especialistas de IA separadamente.
        </p>
        <div class="neo-actions">
          <a class="neo-btn" href="/diagnostico">Agendar reunião estratégica</a>
          <a class="neo-btn neo-btn-ghost" href="#portfolio">Ver projetos</a>
        </div>
        <div class="neo-trust-strip" aria-label="Indicadores de confiança">
          <span>Publicação orientada</span>
          <span>Automação assistida</span>
          <span>CRM à medida</span>
          <span>Sistema pronto a funcionar</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="neo-hero-stage" aria-label="Dashboard NCS-Studio em tempo real">
        <div class="neo-orbit neo-orbit-one"></div>
        <div class="neo-orbit neo-orbit-two"></div>
        <div class="neo-dashboard">
          <div class="neo-dashboard-top">
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;">
              <span style="width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#22c55e;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(34,197,94,0.2);animation:pulse-dot 2s ease-in-out infinite;flex-shrink:0;"></span>
              <div><strong>NCS Command</strong><span>Painel operacional em tempo real</span></div>
            </div>
            <small style="font-size:0.7rem;opacity:0.4;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;">Ao vivo</small>
          </div>
          <div class="neo-dashboard-grid">

            <!-- Receita wide -->
            <div class="neo-module neo-module-wide" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(34,197,94,0.08),rgba(6,182,212,0.05));">
              <span>Receita gerada pelas automações</span>
              <strong style="font-size:1.9rem;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">€ 482 670</strong>
              <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:4px;height:38px;margin-top:6px;">
                <i style="height:30%;flex:1;background:rgba(34,197,94,0.3);border-radius:3px;display:block;"></i>
                <i style="height:48%;flex:1;background:rgba(34,197,94,0.4);border-radius:3px;display:block;"></i>
                <i style="height:38%;flex:1;background:rgba(34,197,94,0.35);border-radius:3px;display:block;"></i>
                <i style="height:70%;flex:1;background:rgba(34,197,94,0.5);border-radius:3px;display:block;"></i>
                <i style="height:62%;flex:1;background:rgba(34,197,94,0.55);border-radius:3px;display:block;"></i>
                <i style="height:90%;flex:1;background:#22c55e;border-radius:3px;display:block;box-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(34,197,94,0.4);"></i>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Segurança -->
            <div class="neo-module" style="background:rgba(99,102,241,0.07);">
              <span>Segurança</span>
              <strong style="color:#818cf8;">A+</strong>
              <small style="color:rgba(129,140,248,0.7);">SSL · Firewall · 2FA</small>
            </div>

            <!-- Uptime -->
            <div class="neo-module" style="background:rgba(6,182,212,0.06);">
              <span>Uptime</span>
              <strong style="color:#22d3ee;">99.9%</strong>
              <small style="color:rgba(34,211,238,0.6);">365 dias sem falhas</small>
            </div>

            <!-- Pipeline -->
            <div class="neo-module neo-module-wide" style="padding-bottom:14px;">
              <span style="margin-bottom:10px;display:block;">Marcações hoje</span>
              <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:6px;">
                <div style="background:rgba(251,191,36,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(251,191,36,0.2);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px;text-align:center;">
                  <div style="font-size:0.65rem;opacity:0.5;margin-bottom:3px;">Novos</div>
                  <div style="font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;color:#fbbf24;">14</div>
                </div>
                <div style="background:rgba(6,182,212,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(6,182,212,0.2);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px;text-align:center;">
                  <div style="font-size:0.65rem;opacity:0.5;margin-bottom:3px;">Confirm.</div>
                  <div style="font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;color:#22d3ee;">9</div>
                </div>
                <div style="background:rgba(34,197,94,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(34,197,94,0.2);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px;text-align:center;">
                  <div style="font-size:0.65rem;opacity:0.5;margin-bottom:3px;">Concluíd.</div>
                  <div style="font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;color:#22c55e;">6</div>
                </div>
                <div style="background:rgba(168,85,247,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(168,85,247,0.2);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px;text-align:center;">
                  <div style="font-size:0.65rem;opacity:0.5;margin-bottom:3px;">IA resp.</div>
                  <div style="font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;color:#c084fc;">24/7</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="neo-float-card neo-float-one">
          <span>🔒 Certificado SSL · Firewall ativo</span>
          <strong>Dados protegidos e conformes com a LGPD</strong>
        </div>
        <div class="neo-float-card neo-float-two">
          <span>⚡ IA em operação</span>
          <strong>+1 200 atendimentos automatizados este mês</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── IMPACT ── -->
    <section class="neo-impact section-reveal">
      <div class="neo-stat"><strong>+100</strong><span>negócios transformados digitalmente</span></div>
      <div class="neo-stat"><strong>+1M</strong><span>clientes impactados por sistemas que construímos</span></div>
      <div class="neo-stat"><strong>99.9%</strong><span>os nossos sistemas raramente param. E quando param, nós sabemos primeiro</span></div>
      <div class="neo-stat"><strong>24/7</strong><span>as tuas automações captam e qualificam leads mesmo quando não estás</span></div>
      <div class="neo-stat"><strong>2–4 sem</strong><span>da primeira reunião ao sistema no ar e a funcionar</span></div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── PROBLEMA ── -->
    <section class="neo-section section-reveal" id="problema">
      <div class="neo-section-head">
        <p class="neo-kicker">O problema</p>
        <h2>O teu negócio pode estar a perder clientes antes de responder a primeira mensagem.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="neo-service-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr)">
        {problems.map(([title, desc, number]) => (
          <article class="neo-service-card">
            <div class="neo-card-icon">{number}</div>
            <h3>{title}</h3>
            <p>{desc}</p>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── SOLUÇÃO ── -->
    <section class="neo-section section-reveal" id="solucao">
      <div class="v3-sol">
        <div class="v3-sol-copy">
          <p class="neo-kicker">Solução</p>
          <h2>Um painel claro para saber quem precisa da tua atenção e responder no automático.</h2>
          <p>Com a NCS-Studio, cada lead entra num fluxo de acompanhamento. Cada pessoa tem status, histórico e próximo passo. A IA cuida do resto.</p>
          <div>
            <a class="neo-btn" href="/diagnostico">Quero ver como funciona</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="v3-sol-panel">
          <div class="v3-row">
            <span class="v3-av"></span>
            <div><strong>Lead novo pelo WhatsApp</strong><span>Triagem automática pela IA</span></div>
            <span class="v3-tag novo">Novo</span>
          </div>
          <div class="v3-row">
            <span class="v3-av"></span>
            <div><strong>Consulta confirmada</strong><span>Lembrete enviado automaticamente</span></div>
            <span class="v3-tag ag">Agendado</span>
          </div>
          <div class="v3-row">
            <span class="v3-av"></span>
            <div><strong>Sem resposta há 48h</strong><span>Follow-up automático disparado</span></div>
            <span class="v3-tag fu">Follow-up</span>
          </div>
          <div class="v3-row">
            <span class="v3-av"></span>
            <div><strong>Sem contacto há 60 dias</strong><span>Fluxo de reativação ativado</span></div>
            <span class="v3-tag re">Reativação</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── SERVIÇOS ── -->
    <section class="neo-section section-reveal" id="construimos">
      <div class="neo-section-head">
        <p class="neo-kicker">O que construímos</p>
        <h2>Do primeiro clique ao cliente fidelizado. Construímos cada peça do teu sistema digital.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="neo-service-grid">
        {services.map(([title, desc, number]) => (
          <article class="neo-service-card">
            <div class="neo-card-icon">{number}</div>
            <h3>{title}</h3>
            <p>{desc}</p>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── CHAVE NA MÃO ── -->
